<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Access Brokerage to distribute Olympic issue.</title>
<headline>NZ's Access Brokerage to distribute Olympic issue.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Access Brokerage Ltd said on Wednesday it had been appointed to arrange the New Zealand retail distribution of the A$364.4 million Stadium Australia Group public subscription issue.</p>
<p>It will arrange the issue's distribution on behalf of underwriter ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p>The issue, details of which have yet to be released, will raise funds to build the main stadium for the 2000 Sydney Olympics. -- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
